  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="7c3b96f1-264b-5fcc-a9d4-3c3de37ac937" activityNameId="68a9fa59-cb2e-5e00-b976-8717c3b6cc1d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Stack SOFC fuel cell 125kWe, future</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Stack SOFC fuel cell 125kWe, future
The module reflects a solid oxide fuel cell (SOFC) stack with 125 kW electrical output. Inventory based on information from literature and one manufacturer. Life time operation of stack is 48'000h (6 years).;
Synonyms: solid oxide fuel cell, oxidkeramische Hochtemperaturbrennstoffzelle, Festoxid Brennstoffzelle, Festkeramik Brennstoffzelle; 
UUID: 31696b71-8430-3c4a-90f1-462338043145
The module includes the most important materials used for production. Also included is the transport of these materials and the energy needed for production.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Solid oxide fuel cell (SOFC) with unpressurised tubular stack design for central cogeneration use. Performance, stack lifetime and catalyst use according to expected future values for a serial product. Operation with connection to low pressure gas network. Electrical efficiency 47%, total efficiency 80%.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data and manufacturer information 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_31696b71-8430-3c4a-90f1-462338043145.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
